    'ABOUT US': 'WAA’EE KEENYA', 'About Guesthouse Platform': 'Waa’ee waltajjii mana keessummaa',
    'An Ethiopian guesthouse reservation platform designed to make finding and booking guesthouses easier, safer, and more convenient.': 'Waltajjii qabsiisa mana keessummaa Itoophiyaa keessatti, manneen keessummaa argachuu fi qabsiisuu salphaa, nageenya qabu fi mijataa gochuuf qophaa’e.',
    'Guesthouse Platform connects guests with verified guesthouses across Ethiopia through one simple digital platform.': 'Waltajjiin mana keessummaa waltajjii dijitaalaa salphaa tokkoon keessummoota fi manneen keessummaa Itoophiyaa keessatti mirkanaa’an wal qunnamsiisa.',
    'Guesthouse Platform is an Ethiopian reservation platform designed to make finding and booking guesthouses easier, safer, and more convenient.': 'Waltajjiin mana keessummaa waltajjii qabsiisa Itoophiyaa keessatti argachuu fi qabsiisuu salphaa, nageenya qabu fi mijataa gochuuf qophaa’e.',
    'Instead of relying only on phone calls, walk-ins, or informal booking methods, guests can explore available guesthouses, view rooms, make reservations, and receive confirmation through the platform.': 'Bilbila, qaamaan deemuu ykn mala qabsiisaa idilee hin taane qofa irratti hirkachuu mannaa, keessummoonni manneen jiru sakatta’uu, kutaalee ilaalu, qabsiisuu fi waltajjii kanaan mirkaneessa argachuu danda’u.',
    'For guesthouse owners and staff, the platform provides tools for managing guesthouses, rooms, reservations, payments, and daily operations.': 'Abbootii mana keessummaa fi hojjettootaaf, waltajjiin kun manneen, kutaalee, qabsiisota, kaffaltii fi hojii guyyaa guyyaa bulchuuf meeshaalee kenna.',
    'Verified Stays': 'Turtiiwwan mirkanaa’an', 'Guests can discover guesthouses that have passed the verification process.': 'Keessummoonni manneen keessummaa adeemsa mirkaneessaa darbanii argachuu danda’u.',
